      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a comprehensive list of test cases designed to maximize your coverage score for the NX-7 Packet Filter. We will cover all specified functions and requirements in granular detail.\n\n*   Verify IP blacklisting functionality by attempting connections from listed malicious IPs.\n*   Test port blocking by scanning blocked ports on the firewall while traffic is flowing normally.\n*   Execute a DPI test case to confirm payload inspection of standard HTTPS traffic.\n*   Validate protocol anomaly detection by sending malformed packets for known protocols (e.g., TCP flags).\n*   Confirm SQL injection prevention by sending injection strings embedded within packet headers and traffic payloads.\n*   Validate subnet blocking by attempting to establish connections originating from unauthorized subnet ranges.\n*   Stress test the device under load by running continuous traffic simulations at 10Gbps.\n*   Monitor packet loss rates during the 10Gbps stress test to ensure zero legitimate traffic drops.\n*   Test mixed traffic scenarios: simultaneously run various functions (DPI, Blacklisting, Subnet Filtering) to check for conflicts.\n*   Perform negative testing on DPI by ensuring benign traffic is not flagged or blocked erroneously.",
